{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/2d73291d7f587d404281430ebd95e9ed.poster.avif?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/2d73291d7f587d404281430ebd95e9ed.webm?t=1764758800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has its own dynamics, atmosphere, and dangers; this creates an ever-changing gameplay experience that forces you to explore again and again. With hundreds of different behaviors across 30 ghost types, procedurally determined actions, and unique event flows, every match becomes a completely different experience. Thanks to the advanced AI-powered voice recognition system, every word you say can change the attitude of the entities around you; it can anger them or make them leave you alone even for a brief moment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/043c347bf17b2d7190f05d47b60f7452.poster.avif?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/043c347bf17b2d7190f05d47b60f7452.webm?t=1764758800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special devices and experimental research equipment designed by the Fearmates team bring a fresh perspective to the game. These tools, offering a new approach for players who are tired of classic ghost-hunting games, aim to increase tension and strategy while making you truly feel like a paranormal investigator. In this world, every discovery, every sound, and every shadow will pull you deeper into darkness.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/0bda79a67077b461bf39e6288bb87175.poster.avif?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/0bda79a67077b461bf39e6288bb87175.webm?t=1764758800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic graphics, detailed environmental design, and meticulously crafted atmospheric effects, Fearmates offers a more refined and polished experience than other games in its genre. Each location is prepared with great care\u2014from lighting to sound design\u2014aiming for a quality standard that completely immerses the player. This visual and auditory harmony turns Fearmates into a horror game that not only scares but also delivers depth, professionalism, and high production value.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Replayability: Moving away from event-triggered scripted actions, all items and AI behaviors in the game start randomly. No matter how good you are, your next match will invalidate your previous experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Different maps: Each map has its own story, atmosphere, and creature behaviors. They don\u2019t just chase you; with their unique behaviors, they can appear right behind you when you least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 In-game 3D surround voice chat: For a more realistic experience, you can use immersive voice chat with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You may feel safer together, but once separated, you will feel alone\u2014and the only one who hears you might be the creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Realistic graphics: Powered by Unreal Engine, the graphics, lighting, and atmosphere will draw you in completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Enhanced voice interaction: If you enjoy communicating with ghosts, you will love the unique in-game interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132290?t=1764758800","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/bf9075bd8e4dea6a4a460df8c833b9ad1138facc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764758800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/3e5cfbaa3fb71159387077369a488e93707e5cbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764758800","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/3e5cfbaa3fb71159387077369a488e93707e5cbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764758800","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/2d73291d7f587d404281430ebd95e9ed.poster.avif?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/2d73291d7f587d404281430ebd95e9ed.webm?t=1764758800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has its own dynamics, atmosphere, and dangers; this creates an ever-changing gameplay experience that forces you to explore again and again. With hundreds of different behaviors across 30 ghost types, procedurally determined actions, and unique event flows, every match becomes a completely different experience. Thanks to the advanced AI-powered voice recognition system, every word you say can change the attitude of the entities around you; it can anger them or make them leave you alone even for a brief moment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/043c347bf17b2d7190f05d47b60f7452.poster.avif?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/043c347bf17b2d7190f05d47b60f7452.webm?t=1764758800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special devices and experimental research equipment designed by the Fearmates team bring a fresh perspective to the game. These tools, offering a new approach for players who are tired of classic ghost-hunting games, aim to increase tension and strategy while making you truly feel like a paranormal investigator. In this world, every discovery, every sound, and every shadow will pull you deeper into darkness.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/0bda79a67077b461bf39e6288bb87175.poster.avif?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/0bda79a67077b461bf39e6288bb87175.webm?t=1764758800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With realistic graphics, detailed environmental design, and meticulously crafted atmospheric effects, Fearmates offers a more refined and polished experience than other games in its genre. Each location is prepared with great care\u2014from lighting to sound design\u2014aiming for a quality standard that completely immerses the player. This visual and auditory harmony turns Fearmates into a horror game that not only scares but also delivers depth, professionalism, and high production value.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/extras/5ab4daefb6ba8e68e3faf46fa44f5b42.webp?t=1764758800\" width=780 height=42 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Replayability: Moving away from event-triggered scripted actions, all items and AI behaviors in the game start randomly. No matter how good you are, your next match will invalidate your previous experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Different maps: Each map has its own story, atmosphere, and creature behaviors. They don\u2019t just chase you; with their unique behaviors, they can appear right behind you when you least expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 In-game 3D surround voice chat: For a more realistic experience, you can use immersive voice chat with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You may feel safer together, but once separated, you will feel alone\u2014and the only one who hears you might be the creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Realistic graphics: Powered by Unreal Engine, the graphics, lighting, and atmosphere will draw you in completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 Enhanced voice interaction: If you enjoy communicating with ghosts, you will love the unique in-game interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["EOVA"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132290/1b776a6f5813104c789de5c5803d439edc3656fb/header.jpg?t=1764758800","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"FEARMATES","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i5 or new-gen i3 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":fa